---
/* Ambient scribe, as live DOM inside the phone aperture.

   The claim that matters is not "AI writes your note" — everyone says that.
   It is that every drafted line stays ATTACHED to the utterance that produced
   it, so the clinician can check the source instead of trusting a summary. So
   the screen shows a drafted sentence with its source quote pinned underneath,
   which is the part competitors cannot hand-wave. */
---

<div class="scr">
  <div class="scr__bar">
    <span>9:41</span>
    <span class="scr__bar-right" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 18 12" fill="none"><rect x="0" y="7" width="3" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="5" y="5" width="3" height="7" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="10" y="2.5" width="3" height="9.5" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="15" y="0" width="3" height="12" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity=".35"/></svg>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 12" fill="none"><rect x="0.6" y="1.2" width="19" height="9.6" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"/><rect x="2.2" y="2.8" width="13" height="6.4" rx="1.6" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M21.4 4.6v2.8a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.8Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="scr__head">
    <span class="scr__title">Visit note</span>
    <span class="scr__state">Drafting</span>
  </div>
  <p class="scr__sub">Reyes, M. &middot; 47 &middot; Room 4</p>

  <p class="scr__label">History of present illness</p>

  <p class="scr__body">
    Substernal chest tightness with exertional dyspnoea, onset roughly six hours
    ago, <span class="scr__cited">worse when lying flat</span>.
  </p>

  <div class="scr__source">
    <span class="scr__source-head">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 10.2a2.6 2.6 0 0 0 2.6-2.6V4.1a2.6 2.6 0 1 0-5.2 0v3.5A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 8 10.2Z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M4 7.4v.4a4 4 0 0 0 8 0v-.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      What the patient said &middot; 04:18
    </span>
    <p>&ldquo;It gets worse when I lie down flat.&rdquo;</p>
  </div>

  <p class="scr__body scr__body--dim">
    No syncope. No fever. Two prior presentations for the same complaint are in
    the chart.
  </p>

  <p class="scr__label">Assessment &amp; plan</p>
  <p class="scr__body scr__body--dim">
    Chest pain, cause undetermined. ECG and troponin ordered. Cardiology review
    if the second troponin rises.
  </p>

  <p class="scr__learn">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.4 8.6 6 12.2l7.6-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    Written in your phrasing, learned from your edits
  </p>

  <div class="scr__forms">
    <span class="scr__forms-n">24</span>
    <span>letters and forms filled from the chart</span>
  </div>

  <div class="scr__actions">
    <span class="scr__btn scr__btn--ghost">Review</span>
    <span class="scr__btn scr__btn--solid">Sign &amp; send</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .scr {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.8cqw;
    padding: 3cqw 6cqw 5cqw;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--neutral-0) 0%, var(--neutral-5) 100%);
    color: var(--neutral-100);
    font-size: 5cqw;
    line-height: 1.45;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .scr__bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 5cqw; font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    padding-block-end: 1cqw;
  }
  .scr__bar-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.6cqw; }
  .scr__bar-right svg { block-size: 3.6cqw; inline-size: auto; }

  .scr__head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 2cqw; }
  .scr__title { font-size: 6.6cqw; font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
  .scr__state {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    padding: 1.2cqw 2.8cqw;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background-color: var(--solace-10);
    color: var(--solace-80);
    font-size: 4cqw;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  }
  .scr__sub { font-size: 4.4cqw; color: var(--neutral-60); }

  .scr__label {
    margin-block-start: 1.4cqw;
    font-size: 4.2cqw;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--neutral-60);
  }

  .scr__body { font-size: 4.9cqw; line-height: 1.5; }
  .scr__body--dim { color: var(--neutral-80); }
  /* The drafted phrase and its source share one accent, which is what makes the
     link legible without an arrow or a callout. */
  .scr__cited {
    background-color: var(--solace-10);
    border-block-end: 0.5cqw solid var(--solace-40);
    border-radius: 1cqw 1cqw 0 0;
    padding: 0 0.6cqw;
  }

  .scr__source {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.4cqw;
    padding: 3cqw 3.4cqw;
    border-radius: 3.4cqw;
    border-inline-start: 1cqw solid var(--solace-40);
    background-color: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(from var(--neutral-100) r g b / 0.05),
                0 5px 12px rgb(from var(--neutral-100) r g b / 0.05);
  }
  .scr__source-head {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.6cqw;
    font-size: 3.9cqw; color: var(--neutral-60);
  }
  .scr__source-head svg { inline-size: 3.6cqw; block-size: 3.6cqw; color: var(--solace-80); }
  .scr__source p { font-size: 4.6cqw; color: var(--neutral-90); font-style: italic; }

  .scr__learn {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.8cqw;
    margin-block-start: auto;
    font-size: 3.9cqw;
    color: var(--neutral-60);
  }
  .scr__learn svg { inline-size: 3.4cqw; block-size: 3.4cqw; flex: none; color: var(--solace-60); }

  .scr__forms {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.4cqw;
    padding: 3cqw 3.4cqw;
    border-radius: 3.4cqw;
    background-color: var(--solace-0);
    font-size: 4.3cqw;
    color: var(--solace-100);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .scr__forms-n {
    font-size: 7cqw;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    color: var(--solace-80);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .scr__actions { display: flex; gap: 2.4cqw; }
  .scr__btn {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3.2cqw;
    border-radius: 3cqw;
    font-size: 4.7cqw;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  }
  .scr__btn--ghost { border: 0.5cqw solid var(--neutral-20); color: var(--neutral-90); background-color: var(--white); }
  .scr__btn--solid { background-color: var(--solace-80); color: var(--white); }
</style>
